  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap rose 3.0% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $304.97B (3.0% higher over 30D) implies fresh dry powder entering crypto rails\u2014usually a constructive backdrop for settlement, trading, and on-chain cash demand. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOSVdzcTRrODFKb0FGa0taOWUtS1JRVTY1a05NYzJ3eEdSdGtfT0JVRHVWSld1NUxqb004aUVRaGlpajVIamdiUGkzVnR4TkdpcGpqTGhmM1NlVXpWMUs5dDRXT2RIcUFvS2ZyUWcwQW05SXhIa2lOUFR2S0NyZkNQMnBUZlRYbVFBbm9RUXFYVlVYeVBXQmlaMjBteVdfdVRJX3pEZHVYaXdQMDlacjJMWFpHVQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SoFi, Kraken link up to bridge banking, stablecoin and crypto trading</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/regulation/wyoming-stable-token-chainlink-proof-of-reserve-frnt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wyoming Puts Its Stablecoin Reserves Onchain With Under $1 Million Outstanding</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/05/dollar-backed-stablecoins-can-push-local-currencies-lower-bank-of-korea-study-finds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dollar-backed stablecoins can push local currencies lower, Bank of Korea study finds</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
